# my_portfolio – Project rules

## Images and assets
- **Always put image assets in the `public/` tree** so Next.js can serve them. When adding or referencing new images (e.g. from `images/` or elsewhere), copy or move them into the matching path under `public/` (e.g. `public/images/incident-response-simulator/`) so URLs like `/images/...` work. Do this proactively; don’t wait for the user to ask.

## Dev server port
- **Always run the app locally on port 3000** for this project.
- Use `npm run dev` (which runs `next dev -p 3000`) or `./start-dev.sh`.
- Each project/repo has its own port (e.g. another project uses 3003); this repo is 3000 only.
